<ul>
<li><code>&lt;txp::vimeo video=&quot;xxx&quot; other=&quot;&quot; txt=&quot;yyy&quot;setcookie=&quot;1&quot; /&gt; setcookie=&quot;1&quot;</code> sets the cookie. other is not needed if video is NeMe produced.</li>
<li><code>&lt;txp::vimeos cat=&quot;cat&quot; txt=&quot;yyy&quot; other=&quot;&quot; setcookie=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;</code> other is not needed if video is NeMe produced.</li>
<li><code>&lt;txp::figure id=&quot;6&quot; caption=&quot;some caption&quot; class=&quot;some classes&quot; /&gt;</code></li>
<li><code>&lt;txp::youtube video=&quot;#&quot; txt=&quot;#&quot; setcookie=&quot;1&quot; /&gt;</code></li>
